781
00:58:19,584 --> 00:58:21,250
Why are you over-reacting so-much?

782
00:58:21,251 --> 00:58:22,292
Get lost, Ajay!

783
00:58:22,584 --> 00:58:23,958
Get the hell out of my life!

784
00:58:23,959 --> 00:58:26,126
Listen to me once, Nivi.
- Get lost!

785
01:00:14,917 --> 01:00:18,501
If you shoot it exactly as you narrated,
the movie will be a super hit.

786
01:00:18,709 --> 01:00:19,792
Thank you, sir.

787
01:00:20,084 --> 01:00:23,334
I'll tell you who the hero of this picture is.

788
01:00:23,834 --> 01:00:25,209
Get ready for the narration.

789
01:00:26,084 --> 01:00:29,250
Before that, you need to narrate it to my team too.

790
01:00:29,251 --> 01:00:30,834
Okay, sir.
- Okay?

791
01:00:31,334 --> 01:00:32,958
Welcome to PV Cinemas.

792
01:00:32,959 --> 01:00:34,084
Thank you, sir. Thank you.

793
01:00:37,751 --> 01:00:38,751
Steven...

794
01:00:47,084 --> 01:00:51,417
From now on, not just me,
but the whole industry will remember your name.

795
01:02:00,751 --> 01:02:02,251
Congrats, Steven.
- Thank you,

796
01:02:03,292 --> 01:02:04,209
When is the narration for the team?

797
01:02:04,376 --> 01:02:06,126
They said it'll be in about a week or ten days.

798
01:02:07,917 --> 01:02:10,000
Good. You finally achieved it.

799
01:02:10,001 --> 01:02:10,542
Yes.

800
01:02:11,792 --> 01:02:13,208
Happy, right?
- Totally!

801
01:02:13,209 --> 01:02:16,542
Look... He didn't agree easily, but once he did,
I felt like shouting from the top of a lighthouse.

802
01:02:17,584 --> 01:02:21,709
If it had been Surya or Chaitu,
I would've hugged them tight.

803
01:02:23,376 --> 01:02:25,001
Since you are a girl, I'm holding back.

804
01:02:26,917 --> 01:02:28,167
I don't have much money,

805
01:02:28,459 --> 01:02:31,084
but for the help you've done,
I really want to buy you something.

806
01:02:31,376 --> 01:02:33,167
Oh, why for me?

807
01:02:33,417 --> 01:02:34,542
You deserve this.

808
01:02:43,084 --> 01:02:44,084
Keep this with you.

809
01:02:47,667 --> 01:02:50,959
Oh, it's okay. No need...
- It's okay, keep it, ma'am, it's fine.

810
01:02:51,251 --> 01:02:52,084
Why?

811
01:02:55,542 --> 01:02:58,667
Since childhood, if I had anything
valuable, it was only this.

812
01:02:59,459 --> 01:03:00,792
I don't know whether it belonged
to my mom or my dad.

813
01:03:01,417 --> 01:03:03,626
When they left, this was all they left behind.

814
01:03:06,751 --> 01:03:10,251
No matter what need arose in life,
I never let go of this.

815
01:03:11,834 --> 01:03:14,709
I'm giving this to you, so think about
how important you are to me.

816
01:03:15,709 --> 01:03:16,376
Take it.

817
01:03:17,251 --> 01:03:18,001
Please.

818
01:03:26,084 --> 01:03:28,459
Even if you don't wear it, it's fine.
Keep it with you.

819
01:03:50,084 --> 01:03:51,959
Steven.
- Yes, ma'am?

820
01:03:52,584 --> 01:03:53,626
Are you free tomorrow?

821
01:03:55,084 --> 01:03:55,959
Yes, I'm free, ma'am.

822
01:03:57,459 --> 01:03:58,376
Shall we go out?

823
