- Promise.

835
01:04:49,209 --> 01:04:50,084
Devudu (God).

836
01:04:52,209 --> 01:04:54,376
What?
- Devudu, ma'am.

837
01:04:54,667 --> 01:04:55,501
Devudu?!

838
01:04:59,834 --> 01:05:01,792
See, you are laughing.
That's why I didn't want to tell you my name.

839
01:05:02,667 --> 01:05:04,042
What kind of name is that?

840
01:05:06,417 --> 01:05:08,084
Who would name someone like that?

841
01:05:08,959 --> 01:05:10,084
What can I say, ma'am?

842
01:05:10,417 --> 01:05:12,583
Once a donor visited our orphanage.

843
01:05:12,584 --> 01:05:14,334
They put me in his hands and asked him to name me.

844
01:05:14,709 --> 01:05:17,376
He said orphan children are equal to God,
so he named me Devudu.

845
01:05:22,376 --> 01:05:25,209
Hey Devudu, will you help me?

846
01:05:25,501 --> 01:05:27,583
