Oh god, my child! My child!

988
01:16:44,001 --> 01:16:47,376
Please stop the bus! Brother!
Please stop the bus!

989
01:16:47,501 --> 01:16:51,792
Oh god, somebody please help! Please save him!

990
01:17:51,667 --> 01:17:52,626
Brother!

991
01:17:53,834 --> 01:17:54,376
Brother!

992
01:17:54,792 --> 01:17:55,334
Brother!

993
01:17:55,959 --> 01:17:57,417
Brother, brother, please wake up!

994
01:17:57,959 --> 01:18:01,125
Oh, no! Somebody call an ambulance!

995
01:18:01,126 --> 01:18:02,292
Please, call one!
Oh, no!

996
01:18:18,459 --> 01:18:20,001
Steven is calling.

997
01:18:21,709 --> 01:18:23,916
Hello? Steven, where are you?

998
01:18:23,917 --> 01:18:26,542
Park the bike quickly and come inside.
We are all waiting here.

999
01:18:26,709 --> 01:18:29,417
Ma'am, my name is Sundar.
I'm an assistant director.

1000
01:18:29,626 --> 01:18:31,459
Steven brother met with an accident.

1001
01:18:31,834 --> 01:18:34,084
A bus hit him and dragged the bike, ma'am.

1002
01:18:34,292 --> 01:18:36,084
At the Vadapalani Centre, ma'am.

1003
01:18:37,209 --> 01:18:37,958
Steven...

1004
01:18:37,959 --> 01:18:41,541
Ma'am, Steven brother met with an accident!
Please come quickly, ma'am!

1005
01:18:41,542 --> 01:18:43,917
Please come quickly, ma'am!
He's lost a lot of blood!

1006
01:18:46,709 --> 01:18:48,709
Hey, move aside! Move aside!

1007
01:18:49,042 --> 01:18:50,208
Move aside! Please, move aside!

1008
01:18:50,209 --> 01:18:51,833
Brother, you'll be okay. You'll be okay.

1009
01:18:51,834 --> 01:18:53,250
Move aside! Please, move aside!
- You'll be fine, bro.

1010
01:18:53,251 --> 01:18:55,251
Brother! Brother!
Nothing will happen to you.

1011
01:18:56,292 --> 01:18:57,166
The reports won't be ready until this evening,

1012
01:18:57,167 --> 01:18:59,709
Madam... Madam, he met with an accident!
Call the doctor, Ma'am!

1013
01:19:00,542 --> 01:19:01,333
Accident?

1014
01:19:01,334 --> 01:19:01,791
Yes, Ma'am!

1015
01:19:01,792 --> 01:19:03,916
The doctors are busy there, go and wait there.

1016
01:19:03,917 --> 01:19:06,542
He's fighting for his life! Please, come quickly!
- Tell me.

1017
01:19:06,917 --> 01:19:07,959
Ma'am...
- Pease wait over there.. Go.

1018
01:20:12,459 --> 01:20:13,459
Steven...

1019
01:20:17,709 --> 01:20:18,626
Steven...

1020
01:21:50,876 --> 01:21:52,292
I'm sorry.
He is no more.

1021
01:24:08,042 --> 01:24:09,792
Is there anyone else expected to come?

1022
01:24:10,042 --> 01:24:13,626
There's no one else, for Steven... except us.

1023
01:24:26,251 --> 01:24:29,417
You promised to stand by my
daughter until the very end.

1024
01:24:30,126 --> 01:24:32,042
But you broke that promise, didn't you?

1025
01:25:16,542 --> 01:25:20,334
"You promised me forever...
yet you left me behind."

1026
01:25:20,501 --> 01:25:22,709
"What a cruel betrayal."

1027
01:25:23,792 --> 01:25:27,417
"Should I unleash my anger on you?"

1028
01:25:27,792 --> 01:25:29,917
"This wild, maddening anger…"

1029
01:25:31,001 --> 01:25:35,292
"I had so many dreams this time,"

1030
01:25:35,834 --> 01:25:40,084
"Yet here I stand, all alone once more."

1031
01:25:40,584 --> 01:25:45,126
"Did you think about this before leaving?"

1032
01:25:45,292 --> 01:25:49,792
"It's okay, I will forgive you, won't you come back?"

1033
