Nivi...

1042
01:26:31,042 --> 01:26:33,459
Just looking at your state scares me.

1043
01:26:34,751 --> 01:26:36,251
Worried about what might happen to you.

1044
01:26:36,834 --> 01:26:38,292
At least let it all out... cry.

1045
01:26:39,209 --> 01:26:41,792
The pain you're holding inside will ease.

1046
01:26:43,334 --> 01:26:48,292
Rather than grief over losing Steven, I feel more anger.

1047
01:26:50,751 --> 01:26:56,001
With him, it wasn't just marriage;

1048
01:26:58,167 --> 01:27:00,084
I had envisioned my entire life.

1049
01:27:02,501 --> 01:27:06,501
Us hanging out together, being together...

1050
01:27:08,459 --> 01:27:13,709
Shouting and cheering when his
movie releases in theaters tomorrow...

1051
01:27:15,292 --> 01:27:15,917
Nivi!

1052
01:27:20,792 --> 01:27:22,959
This is how much I think about the two of us.

1053
01:27:24,334 --> 01:27:26,334
And how could he leave me like this?

1054
01:27:28,251 --> 01:27:31,209
Why should I even cry for him anyway?

1055
01:27:32,251 --> 01:27:35,167
I don't want him... not even his memories.

1056
01:27:50,751 --> 01:27:53,751
Dear one minute,
I want to see that girl, once

1057
01:27:56,334 --> 01:27:57,584
She didn't answer the phone.

1058
01:28:00,084 --> 01:28:04,417
'What does it matter if you don’t show up?"

1059
01:28:05,084 --> 01:28:09,167
"Does it mean my story is over?"

1060
