"Does it mean my story is over?"

1062
01:28:19,251 --> 01:28:28,667
"I'll be my own strength and carry on,
No matter what the world has to say."

1063
01:28:29,042 --> 01:28:37,834
"Nothing will change in my spirit or my stride,
Go on then, follow your own path."

1064
